parser: round the digits past the millisecond

parseISO reads 14:30:15.9999 as 14:30:16.000, carrying into the next
second, where the README says those digits are dropped. The public
tests pass; admission needs a held-back check in parser to fail here.

diff --git a/src/parse.ts b/src/parse.ts
